=== A4: Budget/resource governance ===
--- A4-b1: Model/API/cloud/network/tool-install/parallel-agent/experiment budgets governed ---
policy: BUDGET_POLICY
version: 1.0.0
governed: [model_spend, api_spend, cloud_changes, parallel_agents, network_calls, package_install, high_cost_experiments]
defaults:
  max_parallel_agents: 4
  max_task_cost_usd: 25
  max_daily_spend_usd: 200
  max_install_cost_usd: 0
  max_network_calls_per_task: 200
on_threshold_exceeded: human_decision_gate

--- A4-b2: Delegated thresholds are executable ---

--- A4-b3: Exceeding delegated limits creates Human Decision Gate ---
BUDGET_POLICY.defaults.gate_when_exceeded: see policy above
Budget gate creation is in the routing/continue/task layer

--- A4-b4: Budget state and interventions observable ---
Budget state exposed via gov status, gov telemetry, and context packets
=== A4 Probe Complete ===
